        <activityName xml:lang="en">Lime, from carbonation, at regional storehouse</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Lime, from carbonation, at regional storehouse
Values originate from a single producer of lime from carbonation in Switzerland, which, however, can be considered typical for the Swiss market.;
Formula: CaCO3; 
Synonyms: Zuckerrübenkalk, Ricokalk; 
UUID: 2e3a6ccd-0c16-3510-8197-4d7c54a4f03a
Lime from carbonation is a by-product of the sugar fabrication. No further processing is required to obtain a commercial lime fertiliser. As a consequence, only transports from the manufacturer to the regional storehouse were taken into consideration for this inventory. 
Location: The values refer to the market situation in Switzerland. 
Technology: Values refer to a commonly used technology for this product.
Time period: Year when data for the inventory were communicated
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data retrieved from a Swiss manufacturer. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2e3a6ccd-0c16-3510-8197-4d7c54a4f03a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
